tes a serious lack of reverence for the sacrament.", "reference": "2020 December 18, Robert Paterson, “Consecrated bread should not be posted to communicants”, in Church Times:"}, {"text": "Clergy higher up the candle had different ideas. From the 1920s, Anglo-Papalism had favoured Roman fashions, and many of the Catholic clergy wore Latin cassocks — with plain or lacy cottas, and birettas — for the Offices; and, eschewing the surplice, an amice and alb — usually with Latin vestments — for the eucharist.", "reference": "2022 May 27, Philip Goff, “Platinum Jubilee: The way we wore”, in Church Times:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": []}, {"language": {"code": "en", "name": "English"}, "partOfSpeech": "verb", "pronunciations": [{"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈkæn.dəl/", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "[ˈcʰæn.dl̩]", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈkeə̯n.dəl/", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "[ˈcʰeən.dl̩]", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈkɛə̯n.dəl/", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "[ˈcʰɛən.dl̩]", "tags": []}], "forms": [{"word": "candles", "tags": ["present", "singular", "third-person"]}, {"word": "candling", "tags": ["participle", "present"]}, {"word": "candled", "tags": ["participle", "past"]}, {"word": "candled", "tags": ["past"]}], "senses": [{"definition": "(embryology, transitive) To observe the growth of an embryo inside (an egg), using a bright light source.", "tags": ["transitive"], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(pottery, transitive) To dry (greenware) prior to the firing cycle, setting the kiln at 200° Celsius until all water is removed from the greenware.", "tags": ["transitive"], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(transitive) To check (an item, such as an envelope) by holding it between a light source and the eye.", "tags": ["transitive"], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": []}], "source": {"url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/candle", "license": {"name": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}}}}